# Dock "Options → Assign To" desktop pins, checked by check.sh (read-only; not applied).
# Format (pipe-delimited): Display name | bundle id | desktop
#   desktop: 1..N = "This Desktop" on Desktop N of the main display; none = not assigned
#   Bundle ids are matched case-insensitively (macOS stores them lowercased).
#   YouTube Music is a Chrome web app with its own bundle id.
# Blank lines and lines beginning with # are ignored.
Slack|com.tinyspeck.slackmacgap|1
WhatsApp|net.whatsapp.WhatsApp|1
Granola|com.granola.app|1
Google Chrome|com.google.Chrome|2
Cursor|com.todesktop.230313mzl4w4u92|3
Cursor Nightly|co.anysphere.cursor.nightly|3
Grok Bot|com.anysphere.sand|3
Spotify|com.spotify.client|4
YouTube Music|com.google.Chrome.app.cinhimbnkkaeohfgghhklpknlkffjgod|4
Ghostty|com.mitchellh.ghostty|none
CotEditor|com.coteditor.CotEditor|none
